    {
      "pool_size": 25,
      "pool_returned": 25,
      "candidates": [
        {
          "entry_id": 2802,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.5919221,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do I need a referral from a primary care doctor to book with a specialist?\nAnswer: You can book a visit with any of our practitioners without a referral.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2806,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.36043817,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I do if my insurance isn't listed or I am out-of-network?\nAnswer: You can pay out-of-pocket for your visit, and we can provide you with an itemized receipt to submit to your insurer for potential reimbursement.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2819,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.34238586,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "hree weeks apart. We do not remove skin tags, moles or other skin lesions for cosmetic reasons.\n\n## Medical examinations for work, driving and sport\n\nWe do not carry out commercial driver (DOT) medical examinations, pilot medicals or immigration medical examinations. A sports physical before joining a team or a competition is done in a standard GP appointment.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2807,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.32879466,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How much will my visit cost if I am paying out-of-pocket?\nAnswer: Out-of-pocket rates are $120 for a General Practitioner (GP) visit, $180 for a Dentist appointment, and $160 for all other specialist consultations.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2803,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.31241372,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I bring to my first appointment?\nAnswer: Please bring a valid photo ID, your insurance card, and any relevant prior lab or test results related to your case.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2804,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.30512673,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2817,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.29940224,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n\n## Registering as a new patient\n\nNew patients fill in three forms at their first visit:\n\n- Form PR-1, New Patient Registration: your contact details, emergency contact a",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2818,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.29334992,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n\n## Who can see your medical record\n\nYour record can be seen only by the practitioners and staff involved in your care at the clinic, and by the staff who ha",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2819,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.29033455,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n\n## Annual physical examination\n\nAn annual physical is a preventive check-up for adults who feel well. It includes a review of your medical history and current medicines; y",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2812,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.2879191,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "d on the other side of your mouth for the first few days. For pain, use the over-the-counter painkiller the dentist recommended at your appointment.\n\nContact us if the bleeding has not stopped after f",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2817,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.27412468,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " your last name and date of birth. The kiosk cannot take payments: any copay or self-pay amount is paid at the front desk.\n\n## Language interpreters\n\nFree telephone interpreting is available in more t",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2815,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.2714882,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n\n## If you are running late\n\nCall the front desk on (212) 555-0142 as soon as you know you will be late, so we can tell the practitioner and plan around it. The phone line is answered M",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2816,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.26675528,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "only the clinic's name, a callback number and your first name - never the reason for the call or any health details.\n\n## Messages we will never send\n\nWe will never ask for your card number, bank detai",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2805,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.25090715,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Which health insurance plans do you accept?\nAnswer: We accept most major insurance providers, including Blue Cross Blue Shield, Aetna, Cigna, UnitedHealthcare, and Medicare. If you're unsure",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2816,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.24923818,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n\n## Text message reminders\n\nWe send a reminder by text message 48 hours before your appointment and another 2 hours before it. Our messages always ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2811,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.24861884,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " is not in-network. AARP Medicare Advantage plans from UnitedHealthcare are in-network when the plan is a PPO, and not in-network when it is an HMO.\n\n## Medicare and Medicaid\n\nWe accept Original Medic",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2818,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.2438875,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "ltation for your personal use, as long as you tell the practitioner before you start. Staff and other patients must not be recorded or photographed.\n\n## How long we keep records\n\nWe keep adult medical",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2819,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.24128729,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "r blood glucose readings to each review, and bring your inhalers if you have asthma or COPD, so the GP can check your technique.\n\n## Ear wax removal\n\nWe remove ear wax by microsuction, which uses a sm",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2820,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.23599781,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n\nYour itemized receipt lists each procedure done at your visit by its billing code. Medical procedures use five-digit CPT codes, and dental procedures use CDT cod",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2812,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.23427336,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Dental care guide\n\n## What a dental appointment covers\n\nA routine dental appointment includes an examination of your teeth and gums and a professional cleaning. Fillings and extractions are usually ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2811,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.22901405,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n\nThis guide lists, plan by plan, the health insurance plans we are in-network with. Insurance companies sell many plans under one brand name, and being in-network with a company",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2810,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.22869137,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How early should I arrive before my scheduled appointment time?\nAnswer: If it is your first visit to our clinic, please arrive 15 minutes before your appointment time to complete your regist",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2815,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.2223781,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " room has to be prepared and cleaned between patients.\n\n## If the clinic is running late\n\nSometimes an earlier appointment takes longer than planned. If your practitioner is running more than 20 minut",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2812,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.21733774,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "r if you have ever taken a bisphosphonate such as alendronate (Fosamax) for bone density. These medicines change how the dentist plans an extraction. Do not stop taking them before your appointment un",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2811,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.21176276,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " visit at check-in. The front desk can estimate that amount for you if you give them your plan details before the visit.\n\n## Updating your insurance\n\nIf your insurance has changed since your last visi",
          "text_truncated": true
        }
      ],
